        "original_id": "90086cb3-8772-5a73-b043-e16b487f17b0",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Samuel Flores Borrego; Jorge Eduardo Costilla Sánchez\n- Organizations: Gulf Cartel\n- Events: Infighting in the Gulf Cartel\n- Concepts: Metros; Rojos\n\nFacts:\n- Jorge Eduardo Costilla Sánchez was born on 1 August 1971.\n- Jorge Eduardo Costilla Sánchez was a former Mexican drug lord and a top leader of the Gulf Cartel.\n- Upon his arrest, Samuel Flores Borrego became the right-hand man of Jorge Eduardo Costilla Sánchez.\n- Samuel Flores Borrego died in September 2011.\n- The infighting in the Gulf Cartel was a series of confrontations between the Metros and the Rojos, two factions within the Gulf Cartel.\n- The power struggle between the Metros and the Rojos began directly after the death of Samuel Flores Borrego in September 2011.",
